{"id":"53529","nombre":"Almojábanas (pan de queso colombiano)","original":"Almojábanas (Colombian Cheese Bread)","categoria":"Side","origen":"Colombia","imagen":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/ymk7gt1783803106.jpg","video":"","enlace":"https://www.mycolombianrecipes.com/colombian-cheese-bread-almojabanas/#recipe","etiquetas":[],"ingredientes":[["Harina de maíz (polenta)","1 1/4 tazas","Cornmeal"],["Queso fresco","3 tazas","Queso Fresco"],["Mozzarella","1 taza","Mozzarella"],["Manteca","2 cdas","Butter"],["Polvo de hornear","1 cdta","Baking Powder"],["Sal","1/4 cdta","Salt"],["Huevos","2","Eggs"],["Leche","4 cdas","Milk"]],"pasos":["Precalentar el horno a 200 °C.","Procesar la harina de maíz precocida (masarepa) con el queso.","Agregar el resto de los ingredientes y mezclar bien.","Dividir en 8 porciones iguales y formar bolitas.","Ponerlas en una placa engrasada y hornear unos 25 a 30 minutos, o hasta que estén doradas. Servir tibias."]}